
==========================================================================
T1. Does the derived line actually divide who banks a service year?
==========================================================================
The line is  regularSeasonEndDate - 171 days,  derived per season, never
hard-coded. It moves from 2011-04-10 to 2025-04-10 across the window.

The hard prediction: a man on the active roster only from day +1 onward
CANNOT reach 172 days, so he must show 0 years of service the next spring.

service cells available 2596; bare integers dropped 212; usable 2384

measured on the DEBUT date:
  on or before the line    n  185  banked a full year    3  1.6%
  line +1 to +14           n  182  banked a full year    2  1.1%
  line +15 or later        n 2017  banked a full year   10  0.5%
measured on the ROSTER-ADD date from the wire (service starts here):
  on or before the line    n  122  banked a full year    2  1.6%
  line +1 to +14           n  190  banked a full year    2  1.1%
  line +15 or later        n 1985  banked a full year   10  0.5%

violations of the hard prediction (joined after the line, still banked a year): 12 of 2175
