T6. Roster need
==========================================================================
A club with an injury promotes when it must, whatever the calendar says.
IL placements by the promoting club in the 21 days before the debut, from
the wire. Available from 2009 on: the wire holds 102-177 rows a season in
2005-2008 against 6,055 in 2009, so no earlier season can carry it.

  all debuts 2009-2025
    no IL placement in 21 days  n 1132  costly  31  free  58  ratio 1.554  p=0.0548
    at least one IL placement   n 2495  costly 124  free 250  ratio 1.674  p=0.0000
  incentive-present group
    no IL placement in 21 days  n  199  costly   4  free   4  ratio 0.801  p=1.0000
    at least one IL placement   n  377  costly  14  free  37  ratio 2.117  p=0.0160

  mean IL placements in the 21 days before: costly zone 2.26 (n=155), free zone 2.01 (n=308)

